  "description": "We've given the classic Italian bolognese a vegetarian update by replacing the meat with hearty, wholesome lentils. This thick tomatoey sauce is combined with spaghetti in the pan and topped off with a helping of grated Parmesan cheese. Buon Appetito!!\n*Due to recent sourcing challenges, we’ve replaced spaghetti with fettuccine, which\nmay look different to the picture. Don’t worry, your recipe will be just as tasty!",
