  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Cook fettuccine in boiling water until ‘al dente’, 11 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/2 cup for 2P / 1 cup for 4P), then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d9269b6ec352636ca1954b/step-cb2af600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate carrot. Thinly slice celery. Finely chop garlic.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d9269b6ec352636ca1954b/step-94707410.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook carrot and celery until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Stir in garlic seasoning, herby tomato seasoning and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Reduce to medium heat. Add lentils, passata, reserved pasta water, the butter and brown sugar and cook until thickened, 1-2 mins.\n• Add cooked fettuccine and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d9269b6ec352636ca1954b/step-9574f120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide hearty lentil fettuccine bolognese between bowls.\n• Top with Cheddar cheese to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d9269b6ec352636ca1954b/step-695cdb30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
